user: In the diagram, two concentric circles are drawn with $O$ as their common center. The outer circle is divided into two equal areas, and the inner circle has two-thirds of its area shaded. If the area of the larger circle is $81\pi,$ determine the total area of the shaded regions. The diagram is as follows: 
